Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 16:23:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] Add PdfExport.cs with multi-engine PDF generation
 (vector/raster/HTML) and COM integration - Create unified PdfExport entry
 point supporting Auto, PrintVector, PrintRaster, and ModelHtml engines -
 Extend Converter COM interface with SavePdf method and PdfEngine property for
 format selection - Refactor PrintWrapper to support both vector
 (EmfVectorPdfWriter) and raster (EmfPdfWriter) output modes - Implement
 direct memory loading in V7Table via LoadMoxelFromMemory() to bypass
 serialization overhead - Fix temporary file leakage in
 MemoryReader.ReadFromCSheetDoc by ensuring proper cleanup of mxl files

